OL,3,ABrad Pitt and Florence Pugh pitch for
OL,4,AJames Bond villain role
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe have barely come up for breath since
OL,7,FRobert Pattinson was picked as the new
OL,8,FJames Bond, but A-listers are already
OL,9,Fjostling for position to play his enemy
OL,10,Fin the next 007 movie.
OL,12,FAt the premiere of his new film in
OL,13,FHollywood on Monday, Brad Pitt was
OL,14,Fasked by Extra TV if he would like to
OL,15,Fplay the villain in director Denis
OL,16,FVilleneuve's forthcoming spy movie.
OL,18,FWith a wink at the camera, the star
OL,19,Freplied: "Robert! Denis! You know, I'd
OL,20,Flike to do that. I'd be up for that. My
OL,21,Fman Javier [Bardem] did it so well.
OL,22,FIt's tall shoes, but I'd take that on."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
