OL,3,ABrad Pitt and Florence Pugh pitch for
OL,4,AJames Bond villain role
OL,5,
OL,6,FBardem played Bond baddie Raoul Silva
OL,7,Fin 2012's Skyfall, opposite Daniel
OL,8,FCraig. Asked the same question by
OL,9,FComplex later, Pitt was still
OL,10,Fenthusiastic: "Sign me up for the
OL,11,Fvillain. Get Denis Villeneuve on the
OL,12,Fflip phone, let's go!"
